          "content": {
            "size": 7987,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"constraintConfiguration\":{},\"enableFeaturesConfiguration\":{\"auth.submit\":true,\"se.email.post\":false,\"authUserCN\":true,\"inventorEnrollment\":true,\"useV2EnrollmentVerify\":false,\"pair-in-admin\":true,\"enrollment\":true},\"messageConfiguration\":{\"rbac_session_warningTime\":\"300000\",\"SelfEnrollRegNumInActive\":\"The entered registration/recognition number is inactive.Please login into the <a href=\\\"https://oedci.uspto.gov/OEDCI/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" > Registered practitioner portal </a> to check your status.\",\"rbac_resetTimer\":\"https://int-prod.patentcenter.aws.uspto.gov/reset-timer\",\"idMeInventorNoCustomerNum\":\"No customer number is being associated to your profile. <br /><strong>A customer number can be created in Patent Center after completing the self-enrollment process. Select \\\"Manage/Manage customer numbers\\\" then select \\\"Create new customer number\\\".\",\"rbac_logout\":\"https://idaas-services.uspto.gov/idaas/services/global-logout/url-list/v2\",\"selfEnrollmentAgreement\":\"I have read and understood the Subscriber Agreement (as listed on <a href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/ebc\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Patent Electronic Business Center</a>) and my request to Self-enroll on this online form, is my agreement to abide by the Agreement and the rules and policies of the USPTO regarding the Agreement. I certify that the information, statements and representations provided by me on this online form are true and accurate to the best of my knowledge. I understand that a willfully false certification is a criminal offence and is punishable by law (18 U.S.C. 1001)\",\"obtainPatentCenterAccount\":\"<div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-12\\\"><h4>Patent Center account</h4><p>Have a Patent Center account? <button class=\\\"btn btn-link sign-in-button\\\"> Sign in </button> using your credentials.If you do not have a Patent Center account,follow easy steps to obtain one.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3 mb-3 d-flex getLink\\\"><div class=\\\"card border border-light boxLink\\\"><a style=\\\"color:#000;text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/patent/initiatives/getting-started\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><div class=\\\"d-inline-flex card-body p-0 m-3\\\"><div class=\\\"align-self-start mt-n3\\\"><span class=\\\"material-icons md-2x\\\">person_add</span></div><div class=\\\"ml-2\\\"><h5 class=\\\"card-title\\\">Obtain patent center account</h5><p class=\\\"card-text\\\">Manage all your filings and correspondence at a single location with a Patent Center account.You can now obtain a Patent Center account following a few easy steps</p></div></div></a></div></div></div>\",\"obtainPatentCenterAccountUnAuthUser\":\"<div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-12\\\"><h4>Patent Center account</h4><p>Have a Patent Center account? <button class=\\\"btn btn-link sign-in-button\\\"> Sign in </button> using your credentials. If you do not have a Patent Center account, follow easy steps to obtain one.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"row\\\"><div class=\\\"col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3 mb-3 d-flex getLink\\\"><div class=\\\"card border border-light boxLink\\\"><a style=\\\"color:#000;text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/patents-application-process/applying-online/getting-started-new-users\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><div class=\\\"d-inline-flex card-body p-0 m-3\\\"><div class=\\\"align-self-start mt-n3\\\"><span class=\\\"material-icons md-2x\\\">person_add</span></div><div class=\\\"ml-2\\\"><h5 class=\\\"card-title\\\">Obtain Patent Center account</h5><p class=\\\"card-text\\\">Manage all your filings and correspondence at a single location with a Patent Center account. You can now obtain a Patent Center account following a few easy steps.</p></div></div></a></div></div></div>\",\"SelfEnrollRegNumInuse\":\"The entered registration/recognition number is currently in use. Please enter your registration/recognition number or contact the Patent Electronic Business Center at 866-217-9197 between 6:00 AM to 12:00 midnight Eastern Time Monday – Friday or at ebc@uspto.gov.\",\"inventorEnrollmentError\":\"Patent Center self-enrollment is limited to registered practitioners at this time.  Please complete and mail the notarized form, <a href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/sites/default/files/documents/pto-2042a.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> Patent Electronic Systems verification. </a>\",\"bulkDataDownload\":\"<div class=\\\\\\\"card-body p-0 py-2\\\\\\\"><h4 class=\\\\\\\"card-title\\\\\\\"> Open Data Portal API</h4><p>Use The Open Data Portal (ODP) to select and extract data through adjustable datasets and APIs. In ODP, you can: </p><ul><li>Conduct searches and pull information from all patent application bibliographic, front page and patent relevant data fields.</li><li>Search and download publicly available bulk datasets regularly produced and reviewed.</li><li>Request a JSON or CSV file download.</li></ul></div><div class=\\\\\\\"card-footer border-top-0\\\\\\\"> <a href=https://data.uspto.gov target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn-primary\\\\\\\">Access Open Data Portal </a> </div>\",\"rbac_session_alertTime\":\"1500000\",\"idMeWhatIsCustomerNum\":\"<h5>What is customer number?</h5><p class=\\\"small mb-0\\\">A customer number is a unique number created by the USPTO and is used to designate the correspondence address for your patent application(s). Using a customer number to designate the correspondence address will ensure that you can access your patent application information using your registered Patent Center account. The same customer number can be used for all new patent application filings. <strong> If you currently do not have a customer number, you can create one online in Patent Center after completing the self-enrollment process. Select “Manage/Manage customer numbers” then “Create new customer number”. </strong></p>\",\"rbac_auth\":\"https://auth.uspto.gov/\",\"rbac_account\":\"https://account.uspto.gov/profile\",\"SelfEnrollNameMismatch\":\"The name associated to the entered registration/limited recognition number in OED (Office of Enrollment & Discipline) does not match the USPTO.gov account name for the logged-in user. Please enter the correct registration/limited recognition number or contact the <a href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/learning-and-resources/support-centers/patent-electronic-business-center\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> Patent Electronic Business Center</a>.\",\"assignmentCenterCard\":\"<div class='card-body p-0 py-2 flex-grow-1'><h4 class='card-title'>Assignment Center</h4><p>Search for patent assignments using Basic Search for quick results, or Advanced Search for full control, filtering, and export features.</p></div><div class='card-footer border-top-0 mt-auto'><a href='https://assignmentcenter.uspto.gov/search/patent' target='_blank' class='btn btn-primary'>Access Assignment Center</a></div>\",\"regNoMisatchNameOverride\":\"The entered registration number is incorrect. Please enter the registration number associated with your account.\",\"selfEnrollmentAgreementErrorMessage\":\"Subscriber agreement must be agreed in order to proceed self-enrollment\",\"rbac_myuspto\":\"https://my.uspto.gov\",\"bulkDataDownloadUnAuthUser\":\"<div class=\\\"card-body p-0 py-2\\\"><h4 class=\\\"card-title\\\"> Open Data Portal API</h4><p>Use The Open Data Portal (ODP) to select and extract data through adjustable datasets and APIs. In ODP, you can: </p><ul><li>Conduct searches and pull information from all patent application bibliographic, front page and patent relevant data fields.</li><li>Search and download publicly available bulk datasets regularly produced and reviewed.</li><li>Request a JSON or CSV file download.</li></ul></div><div class=\\\"card-footer border-top-0\\\"> <a href=https://data.uspto.gov target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Access Open Data Portal </a> </div>\",\"SelfEnrollRegNumRetryValidation\":\"You have reached the maximum number of tries to enter your registration number. To reset self-enrollment, please contact the <a href=\\\"https://www.uspto.gov/learning-and-resources/support-centers/patent-electronic-business-center\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" >Patent Electronic Business Center </a>\"},\"systemConfiguration\":{}}"
          },
